DESCRIPTION:It's finally the first Monday of every month\, where the Children's Museum opens its doors during different times throughout the day.In an special opportunity to spend two and a half hours of fun at the Children's Festival\, where Children move between different stations\, each offering a new way to explore the idea of home\, daily life\, and cultures through play and making.
